  "blocks": [
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.quick-decision",
      "id": "quick-decision",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "先判断你是否愿意反复核来源、文字、逻辑、风格和版本，而不只改得顺口。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "editors.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "正向信号：能把事实、引文、推断、意见和待核项分开。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "editors.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "谨慎信号：凭印象补来源、覆盖作者意图，或在审批前把草稿当定稿。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "editors.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "练习审三张虚构编辑简报，七字段为来源、受众、目的、截止时间、风格规则、证据状态、审批安排；“待核”是已记录未确认，未记录才缺失。A：来源甲；受众甲；目的甲；截止周三；风格甲；证据待核；审批交责任编辑，缺0。B：来源未记录；受众乙；目的乙；截止周五；风格未记录；证据待核；审批交责任编辑，缺2。C：来源丙；受众丙；目的丙；截止周四；风格丙；证据已核；审批交指定发布人，缺0。答案0/2/0；只审字段，不发布内容。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "editors.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
